<title>TURKEY: Turk Ege Biracilik H1 profit up.</title>
<headline>Turk Ege Biracilik H1 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1997 final</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>				     H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>				    -------	   -------</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)   365.67  vs     389.57</p>
<p>    Net Profit		    778.14  vs     614.35</p>
<p>    Net sales		   6,592.45  vs   3,758.25</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  1,430.78  vs     633.36</p>
<p>    Exceptional income	  812.63  vs     676.79</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     1,336.43  vs     626.40</p>
<p>    Total debts		 7,646.41  vs   4,699.41</p>
<p>    Equity			9,276.60  vs   5,525.50</p>
<p>    Capital		     2,128.29  vs   1,576.51</p>
<p>NOTE - Brewer Ege Biracilik ve Malt Sanayi A.S. is owned largely by Turkish brewery, automotive and stationery group Anadolu Endustri Holding.</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 78 percent year-on-year consumer price inflation in June.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212 275 08 75</p>
</text>
